# what the generator knows when it recompiles (gen.c: the pc, the decode's SEE) and the state no instruction here
# reaches: the banked stack pointers the original SP_read picks among (nx.sail's reads GPR's last element), SPE's
# sample (nx.sail's constant) and the features' table (IsFeatureImplemented is lowered)
stop _PC
stop SP_EL0
stop SP_EL1
stop SP_EL2
stop SP_EL3
stop SEE
stop SPESampleInFlight
stop FeatureImpl

# what the generator lowers itself (tools/sailgen/README.md, "Builtins"): their Sail is not needed
stop IsFeatureImplemented
stop BranchTo
stop BranchNotTaken
stop EndOfInstruction

# the machine's actions the back end lowers (llvm.h, sg_NAME): the hints, the barriers, the exclusive monitor
stop Hint_Yield
stop Hint_WFE
stop Hint_WFI
stop SendEvent
stop SendEventLocal
stop DataMemoryBarrier
stop DataSynchronizationBarrier
stop SpeculativeStoreBypassBarrierToVA
stop SpeculativeStoreBypassBarrierToPA
stop InstructionSynchronizationBarrier
stop ConsumptionOfSpeculativeDataBarrier
stop SynchronizeErrors
stop TakeUnmaskedSErrorInterrupts
stop Hint_DGH
stop Hint_CLRBHB
stop ProfilingSynchronizationBarrier
stop TraceSynchronizationBarrier
stop ClearExclusiveLocal
stop ProcessorID

# never reached: behind a feature no guest has (a64.profile names no FEAT_TME, FEAT_BRBE, FEAT_SPE, FEAT_BTI,
# FEAT_DGH, FEAT_CLRBHB or FEAT_TRF, so sailgen folds the ifs on them) or behind a fixup's false (EL2Enabled,
# HaveGCS); a generation that reaches one stops on its missing definition
stop TSTATE
stop FailTransaction
stop BRBEBranchOnISB
stop BRBEISB
stop SPEISB
stop AArch64_vESBOperation
stop HCRX_EL2
stop GCSEnabled
stop BTypeCompatible_PACIXSP

# NX's fixups (nx.sail) in their place: the register file is GPR's elements; nothing writes a part of a register; no
# Guarded Control Stack, so its records are never reached; no guarded page; no EL2; no SError
stop EL2Enabled
stop IsHCRXEL2Enabled
stop AArch64_ESBOperation
stop HaveGCS
stop GCSPCREnabled
stop AddGCSRecord
stop LoadCheckGCSRecord
stop GetCurrentGCSPointer
stop SetCurrentGCSPointer
stop InGuardedPage
stop get_R
stop set_R
stop set_R_bits
stop SPESampleAddOpOther
stop AddPACIA
stop AddPACIB
stop AddPACDA
stop AddPACDB
stop AuthIA
stop AuthIB
stop AuthDA
stop AuthDB
stop Strip
stop AddPACGA

# NX's loads and stores (nx.sail): guest memory and the exclusive monitor are ScarletNX's, lowered by the back end; the
# access descriptor is EL0's; a pair is one access; little-endian, no alignment fault, no abort syndrome; a
# prefetch does nothing; a CONSTRAINED UNPREDICTABLE encoding runs as written
stop NewAccDesc
stop AArch64_IsUnprivAccessPriv
stop HaveLSE2Ext
stop BigEndian
stop CheckSPAlignment
stop IsAligned__1
